'' Function-like macros and token builtins must expand inside a '#if' condition.
'' They did not, so '#if TWO( a, b ) = 2' silently took the FALSE branch -- a wrong
'' answer with no diagnostic, which is the worst kind.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-tokens=pp tests/pp/src/ifexpand.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-NOT: FBX0308
'' GOLDEN: expected/ifexpand.out
